Use hidden constant parameter VBICtype for conditional branch limiting of npn / pnp type devices.

Correct Multiplier application: All currents are always scaled by M, so the shot noise sources have not
multiplyed by M again, used /M in white_noise() functions to remain format; white_noise() for resistors
have to multiply still with M because conductances are not.

Use conventional type definition: +1 NPN and -1 PNP

Use alternative ngspice specific limit function pnjlim for inner base-emitter and base-collector junctions
